<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>100 bytes — Em manutenção</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
  <link rel="icon" href="https://cdn.100bytes.co.ao/logo/logo-1752749442.jpg" />
  <style>
    :root{
      --ink:#101418; --muted:#6b7280; --line:#eceef1;
      --accent:#ff6a00; --accent-2:#ff9142; --bg:#f7f8fa;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{margin:0;height:100%}
    body{
      font-family:"Segoe UI",system-ui,-apple-system,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 50% -10%, #fff 0%, var(--bg) 60%);
      color:var(--ink); min-height:100%;
      display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:24px;
    }
    .card{
      width:100%; max-width:560px; text-align:center;
      background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:20px;
      padding:48px 40px; box-shadow:0 10px 40px rgba(16,20,24,.06);
    }
    .logo{height:64px; width:auto; margin:0 auto 28px; display:block}
    .badge{
      display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
      font-size:12.5px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:.02em;
      color:var(--accent); background:#fff4ec; border:1px solid #ffe0cc;
      padding:6px 12px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:22px;
    }
    .badge .pulse{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent);
      box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(255,106,0,.5); animation:p 1.8s infinite}
    @keyframes p{0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(255,106,0,.5)}70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 10px rgba(255,106,0,0)}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(255,106,0,0)}}
    h1{font-size:27px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-.02em; margin:0 0 12px}
    p.lead{font-size:15.5px; line-height:1.6; color:var(--muted); margin:0 auto 28px; max-width:420px}
    .bar{height:8px; background:#f0f2f5; border-radius:999px; overflow:hidden; margin:0 auto 30px; max-width:320px}
    .bar > i{display:block; height:100%; width:40%; border-radius:999px;
      background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));
      animation:slide 1.9s ease-in-out infinite}
    @keyframes slide{0%{margin-left:-40%}100%{margin-left:100%}}
    .contact{display:flex; gap:10px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap}
    .contact a{
      text-decoration:none; font-size:14px; font-weight:600;
      padding:11px 18px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid var(--line); color:var(--ink);
      transition:background .15s,border-color .15s;
    }
    .contact a:hover{background:#fafafa}
    .contact a.primary{background:var(--ink); color:#fff; border-color:var(--ink)}
    .contact a.primary:hover{background:#000}
    .foot{margin-top:30px; font-size:12.5px; color:#9aa1a9}
    @media(max-width:480px){ .card{padding:36px 22px} h1{font-size:23px} }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="card">
    <img class="logo" src="https://cdn.100bytes.co.ao/logo/logo-1752749442.jpg" alt="100 bytes" />
    <div class="badge"><span class="pulse"></span> Em manutenção</div>
    <h1>Estamos a preparar algo novo</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      A nossa loja está temporariamente em manutenção enquanto melhoramos a sua
      experiência. Voltamos muito em breve. Obrigado pela paciência.
    </p>
    <div class="bar"><i></i></div>
    <div class="contact">
      <a class="primary" href="https://wa.me/244928499325" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Falar no WhatsApp</a>
      <a href="mailto:geral@100bytes.co.ao">geral@100bytes.co.ao</a>
    </div>
    <div class="foot">100 Bytes — Soluções Tecnológicas &middot; Luanda, Angola</div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
